@startuml
title SD-B45 Mengakses Link Drive Klien

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam BoxPadding 4
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #999999
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #999999
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECEEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #111111
    ActorBorderColor #999999
    ActorFontColor #111111
    GroupBorderColor #111111
    GroupBackgroundColor transparent
}

actor "Klien" as Klien
boundary "Halaman Project Klien" as HalamanProject
boundary "Detail Project" as DetailProject
control "ProjectController" as ProjectController
entity "Projects Model" as Project
entity "Bookings Model" as Booking

Klien -> HalamanProject : Membuka menu pemesanan/project
HalamanProject -> ProjectController : index()
ProjectController -> Project : ambil project milik klien
Project --> ProjectController : data project
ProjectController --> HalamanProject : tampilkan daftar project
Klien -> HalamanProject : Membuka detail project
HalamanProject -> DetailProject : tampilkan detail project
DetailProject -> ProjectController : show(projectId)
ProjectController -> Project : ambil project dan link RAW/FINAL
Project --> ProjectController : data project
ProjectController -> Booking : ambil status booking
Booking --> ProjectController : data booking
ProjectController -> ProjectController : validasi akses klien dan status booking

alt Link tersedia dan akses valid
    ProjectController --> DetailProject : tampilkan link Drive
    DetailProject --> Klien : link Drive tampil
    Klien -> Klien : membuka link Google Drive
    Klien -> Klien : file/folder Drive tampil
else Link belum tersedia
    ProjectController --> DetailProject : sembunyikan link Drive
    DetailProject --> Klien : link belum tersedia
else Akses tidak valid / booking dibatalkan
    ProjectController --> DetailProject : tampilkan pesan akses ditolak
    DetailProject --> Klien : link tidak dapat diakses
else Link kedaluwarsa
    ProjectController --> DetailProject : tampilkan pesan link kedaluwarsa
    DetailProject --> Klien : akses link ditolak
end

@enduml
